# K1c trace-only diagnostic refinement for munch.
#
# Merge after the K1a and K1b fragments. K1, K1a and K1b all reset before
# Android completed boot, so the remaining suspect set is DEBUG_KERNEL's broad
# dependency cascade together with page-owner/debugfs. Retain the non-invasive
# FTRACE/MM tracepoint infrastructure and MGLRU statistics only.

# CONFIG_DEBUG_KERNEL is not set
# CONFIG_DEBUG_FS is not set
# CONFIG_PAGE_EXTENSION is not set
# CONFIG_PAGE_OWNER is not set
